      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "When you set up an §6Oil Refinery§r, you have two options;\n\nOne, is to set up the machines near the §eDerrick§r itself, and set up localised energy generation there.\n\nThe other is to pipe the fluids all the way back to your base. This is more convenient, as then actually building the Refinery will take less back-and-forth trips, but you will need to pipe fluids long distances.\n\nThe main options for piping fluids are §eBoxducts§r, which you can place individually, but which will quickly be annoying to place after a while, and §6Pipe Anchors§r.\n\n§6Pipe Anchors§r are able to be directly connected from a §610m§r radius with a §6Pipe Wrench§r. §eShift Right-click §rand §eRight-click§r does the job of connecting them. They need to have a §bFluid ID§r to work. Pipe Anchors are decently good at long distance transport and less of a headache to place as Boxducts.",
